 (128,'Princess Mononoke','1997-07-12 00:00:00.000000',26500000,NULL,'ja','?????','Ashitaka, a prince of the disappearing Ainu tribe, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must journey to the west to find a cure. Along the way, he encounters San, a young human woman fighting to protect the forest, and Lady Eboshi, who is trying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conflict.',60.732738,159375308.0,134.0,'Released','The Fate Of The World Rests On The Courage Of One Warrior.',8.2,1983),
