 (169,'Predator 2','1990-11-20 00:00:00.000000',35000000,NULL,'en','Predator 2','Ten years after a band of mercenaries first battled a vicious alien, the invisible creature from another world has returned to Earth -- and this time, it''s drawn to the gang-ruled and ravaged city of Los Angeles. When it starts murdering drug dealers, detective-lieutenant Mike Harrigan and his police force set out to capture the creature, ignoring warnings from a mysterious government agent to stay away.',27.934978,57120318.0,108.0,'Released','Silent. Invisible. Invincible. He''s in town with a few days to kill.',5.9,730),
 (170,'28 Days Later','2002-10-31 00:00:00.000000',5000000,NULL,'en','28 Days Later','Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it''s absolutely impossible to contain.',45.490374,82719885.0,113.0,'Released','His fear began when he woke up alone. His terror began when he realised he wasn''t.',7.1,1777),
 (172,'Star Trek V: The Final Frontier','1989-06-09 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','Star Trek V: The Final Frontier','Capt. Kirk and his crew must deal with Mr. Spock''s half brother who kidnaps three diplomats and hijacks the Enterprise in his obsessive search for God.',19.578249,70200000.0,107.0,'Released','Adventure and imagination will meet at the final frontier.',5.6,376),
