 (176,'Saw','2004-10-01 00:00:00.000000',1200000,NULL,'en','Saw','Obsessed with teaching his victims the value of life, a deranged, sadistic serial killer abducts the morally wayward. Once captured, they must face impossible choices in a horrific game of survival. The victims must fight to win their lives back, or die trying...',63.655973,103911669.0,103.0,'Released','Live or die. Make your choice.',7.2,2184),
