 (179,'The Interpreter','2005-04-08 00:00:00.000000',80000000,'http://www.theinterpretermovie.com/','en','The Interpreter','After Silvia Broome, an interpreter at United Nations headquarters, overhears plans of an assassination, an American Secret Service agent is sent to investigate.',18.69984,162944923.0,128.0,'Released','The truth needs no translation.',6.2,392),
