 (187,'Sin City','2005-04-01 00:00:00.000000',40000000,'http://www.miramax.com/movie/sin-city/','en','Sin City','Welcome to Sin City. This town beckons to the tough, the corrupt, the brokenhearted. Some call it darkà Hard-boiled. Then there are those who call it home ù Crooked cops, sexy dames, desperate vigilantes. Some are seeking revenge, others lust after redemption, and then there are those hoping for a little of both. A universe of unlikely and reluctant heroes still trying to do the right thing in a city that refuses to care.',66.003433,158733820.0,124.0,'Released','Walk down the right back alley in Sin City and you can find anything...',7.2,2691),
