 (196,'Back to the Future Part III','1990-05-25 00:00:00.000000',40000000,'http://www.backtothefuture.com/movies/backtothefuture3','en','Back to the Future Part III','The final installment of the Back to the Future trilogy finds Marty digging the trusty DeLorean out of a mineshaft and looking up Doc in the Wild West of 1885. But when their time machine breaks down, the travelers are stranded in a land of spurs. More problems arise when Doc falls for pretty schoolteacher Clara Clayton, and Marty tangles with Buford Tannen.',45.769562,244527583.0,118.0,'Released','They''ve saved the best trip for last... But this time they may have gone too far.',7.1,2900),
