 (218,'The Terminator','1984-10-26 00:00:00.000000',6400000,'http://www.mgm.com/#/our-titles/1970/The-Terminator/','en','The Terminator','"In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the ""Terminator"" back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?"',74.234793,78371200.0,108.0,'Released','Your future is in his hands.',7.3,4128),
