 (296,'Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines','2003-07-02 00:00:00.000000',200000000,NULL,'en','Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines','It''s been 10 years since John Connor saved Earth from Judgment Day, and he''s now living under the radar, steering clear of using anything Skynet can trace. That is, until he encounters T-X, a robotic assassin ordered to finish what T-1000 started. Good thing Connor''s former nemesis, the Terminator, is back to aid the now-adult Connor à just like he promised.',69.405188,435000000.0,109.0,'Released','The Machines Will Rise.',5.9,2143),
 (297,'Meet Joe Black','1998-11-12 00:00:00.000000',90000000,'http://www.meetjoeblack.com/','en','Meet Joe Black','"When the grim reaper comes to collect the soul of megamogul Bill Parrish, he arrives with a proposition: Host him for a ""vacation"" among the living in trade for a few more days of existence. Parrish agrees, and using the pseudonym Joe Black, Death begins taking part in Parrish''s daily agenda and falls in love with the man''s daughter. Yet when Black''s holiday is over, so is Parrish''s life."',36.069611,142940100.0,178.0,'Released','Sooner or later everyone does.',6.9,1147),
 (298,'Ocean''s Thirteen','2007-06-07 00:00:00.000000',85000000,'http://oceans13.warnerbros.com/','en','Ocean''s Thirteen','Danny Ocean''s team of criminals are back and composing a plan more personal than ever. When ruthless casino owner Willy Bank doublecrosses Reuben Tishkoff, causing a heart attack, Danny Ocean vows that he and his team will do anything to bring down Willy Bank along with everything he''s got. Even if it means asking for help from an enemy.',42.069993,311312624.0,122.0,'Released','What are the odds of getting even? 13 to one.',6.5,1999),
 (302,'Swimming Pool','2003-05-18 00:00:00.000000',7800000,'http://www.marsdistribution.com/xml/flash.html?cfilm=46022','en','Swimming Pool','In the middle of this amusing thriller is a relationship between two different types of females, one is a well know British author and the other is a sex-crazed French teen. The two get into some relationship trouble while living together in this film of psychological imagery and an erotic exploration of the female body.',11.000654,22441323.0,102.0,'Released','On the surface, all is calm',6.4,153),
 (306,'Beverly Hills Cop III','1994-05-24 00:00:00.000000',50000000,NULL,'en','Beverly Hills Cop III','Back in sunny southern California and on the trail of two murderers, Axel Foley again teams up with LA cop Billy Rosewood. Soon, they discover that an amusement park is being used as a front for a massive counterfeiting ring û and it''s run by the same gang that shot Billy''s boss.',20.333953,119208989.0,104.0,'Released',NULL,5.5,434),
 (309,'The Celebration','1998-05-20 00:00:00.000000',1300000,'http://nimbusfilm.dk/film/festen/?lang=en','da','Festen','A grandiose party to celebrate a sixtieth birthday unleashes a family drama with all the lies that conceal horrendous secrets. The eldest son, Christian, stages a showdown with the popular pater familias; his provocative, moving after-dinner speech dislodges all the masks, which finally fall completely as the father-son conflict intensifies and the bewildered guests look on.',10.240917,0.0,105.0,'Released',NULL,7.7,207),
 (310,'Bruce Almighty','2003-05-23 00:00:00.000000',80000000,'http://www.brucealmighty.com/','en','Bruce Almighty','"Bruce Nolan toils as a ""human interest"" television reporter in Buffalo, N.Y. Despite his high ratings and the love of his beautiful girlfriend, Grace, Bruce remains unfulfilled. At the end of the worst day in his life, he angrily ridicules God -- and the Almighty responds, endowing Bruce with all of His divine powers."',109.684788,484572835.0,101.0,'Released','In Bruce we trust',6.4,3012),
