 (320,'Insomnia','2002-05-24 00:00:00.000000',46000000,NULL,'en','Insomnia','Two Los Angeles homicide detectives are dispatched to a northern town where the sun doesn''t set to investigate the methodical murder of a local teen.',41.322708,113714830.0,118.0,'Released','A tough cop. A brilliant killer. An unspeakable crime.',6.8,1148),
