 (326,'Snakes on a Plane','2006-08-06 00:00:00.000000',33000000,NULL,'en','Snakes on a Plane','America is on the search for the murderer Eddie Kim. Sean Jones must fly to L.A. to testify in a hearing against Kim. Accompanied by FBI agent Neville Flynn, the flight receives some unexpected visitors.',19.642328,62022014.0,105.0,'Released','At 30,000 feet, snakes aren''t the deadliest thing on this plane.',5.1,497),
