 (525,'The Blues Brothers','1980-06-17 00:00:00.000000',27000000,NULL,'en','The Blues Brothers','Jake Blues is just out of jail, and teams up with his brother, Elwood on a ''mission from God'' to raise funds for the orphanage in which they grew up. The only thing they can do is do what they do best û play music û so they get their old band together and they''re on their way, while getting in a bit of trouble here and there.',44.714264,115229890.0,133.0,'Released','They''ll never get caught. They''re on a mission from God.',7.5,1065),
