 (534,'Terminator Salvation','2009-05-20 00:00:00.000000',200000000,'https://www.warnerbros.com/terminator-salvation','en','Terminator Salvation','All grown up in post-apocalyptic 2018, John Connor must lead the resistance of humans against the increasingly dominating militaristic robots. But when Marcus Wright appears, his existence confuses the mission as Connor tries to determine whether Wright has come from the future or the past -- and whether he''s friend or foe.',71.862892,371353001.0,115.0,'Released','The End Begins.',5.9,2463),
 (535,'Flashdance','1983-04-14 00:00:00.000000',4000000,NULL,'en','Flashdance','The popular 1980Æs dance movie that depicts the life of an exotic dancer with a side job as a welder who true desire is to get into ballet school. ItÆs her dream to be a professional dancer and now is her chance. The film has a great soundtrack with an Oscar winning song.',18.422323,92921203.0,95.0,'Released','When the dancer becomes the dance.',6.1,302),
 (539,'Psycho','1960-06-16 00:00:00.000000',806948,NULL,'en','Psycho','When larcenous real estate clerk Marion Crane goes on the lam with a wad of cash and hopes of starting a new life, she ends up at the notorious Bates Motel, where manager Norman Bates cares for his housebound mother. The place seems quirky, but fineà until Marion decides to take a shower.',93.067866,32000000.0,109.0,'Released','The master of suspense moves his cameras into the icy blackness of the unexplored!',8.2,2320),
 (540,'D.E.B.S.','2004-01-21 00:00:00.000000',3500000,NULL,'en','D.E.B.S.','The star of a team of teenage crime fighters falls for the alluring villainess she must bring to justice.',6.396936,0.0,91.0,'Released','Evil is so totally busted!',5.6,90),
