 (954,'Mission: Impossible','1996-05-22 00:00:00.000000',80000000,'http://www.missionimpossible.com/','en','Mission: Impossible','When Ethan Hunt, the leader of a crack espionage team whose perilous operation has gone awry with no explanation, discovers that a mole has penetrated the CIA, he''s surprised to learn that he''s the No. 1 suspect. To clear his name, Hunt now must ferret out the real double agent and, in the process, even the score.',75.290998,457696359.0,110.0,'Released','Expect the Impossible.',6.7,2631),
