 (957,'Spaceballs','1987-06-24 00:00:00.000000',22700000,'http://www.mgm.com/view/movie/1873/Spaceballs/','en','Spaceballs','"When the nefarious Dark Helmet hatches a plan to snatch Princess Vespa and steal her planet''s air, space-bum-for-hire Lone Starr and his clueless sidekick fly to the rescue. Along the way, they meet Yogurt, who puts Lone Starr wise to the power of ""The Schwartz."" Can he master it in time to save the day?"',39.890798,38119483.0,96.0,'Released','May the schwartz be with you',6.7,902),
 (978,'Seven Years in Tibet','1997-09-12 00:00:00.000000',70000000,NULL,'en','Seven Years in Tibet','Austrian mountaineer, Heinrich Harrer journeys to the Himalayas without his family to head an expedition in 1939. But when World War II breaks out, the arrogant Harrer falls into Allied forces'' hands as a prisoner of war. He escapes with a fellow detainee and makes his way to Llaso, Tibet, where he meets the 14-year-old Dalai Lama, whose friendship ultimately transforms his outlook on life.',16.92991,131457682.0,136.0,'Released','At the end of the world his real journey began.',7.0,630),
 (979,'Irreversible','2002-05-22 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'fr','IrrTversible','Events over the course of one traumatic night in Paris unfold in reverse-chronological order as the beautiful Alex is brutally raped and beaten by a stranger in the underpass. Her boyfriend and ex-lover take matters into their own hands by hiring two criminals to help them find the rapist so that they can exact revenge. A simultaneously beautiful and terrible examination of the destructive nature of cause and effect, and how time destroys everything.',32.476098,792.0,97.0,'Released','Time destroys everything.',7.1,538),
