 (1164,'Babel','2006-09-08 00:00:00.000000',25000000,NULL,'en','Babel','Tragedy strikes a married couple on vacation in the Moroccan desert, touching off an interlocking story involving four different families.',25.785925,135330182.0,143.0,'Released','If You Want to be Understood...Listen',6.9,1055),
 (1165,'The Queen','2006-09-15 00:00:00.000000',15000000,'http://www.thequeenmovie.co.uk/','en','The Queen','The Queen is an intimate behind the scenes glimpse at the interaction between HM Elizabeth II and Prime Minister Tony Blair during their struggle, following the death of Diana, to reach a compromise between what was a private tragedy for the Royal family and the public''s demand for an overt display of mourning.',19.113278,123384128.0,103.0,'Released','Our Leaders. Ourselves.',6.8,338),
 (1213,'The Talented Mr. Ripley','1999-12-25 00:00:00.000000',40000000,'http://www.miramax.com/movie/the-talented-mr-ripley/','en','The Talented Mr. Ripley','Tom Ripley is a calculating young man who believes it''s better to be a fake somebody than a real nobody. Opportunity knocks in the form of a wealthy U.S. shipbuilder who hires Tom to travel to Italy to bring back his playboy son, Dickie. Ripley worms his way into the idyllic lives of Dickie and his girlfriend, plunging into a daring scheme of duplicity, lies and murder.',31.385257,128798265.0,139.0,'Released','How far would you go to become someone else?',7.0,767),
 (1245,'The Remains of the Day','1993-11-05 00:00:00.000000',11500000,NULL,'en','The Remains of the Day','A rule bound head butler''s world of manners and decorum in the household he maintains is tested by the arrival of a housekeeper who falls in love with him in post-WWI Britain. The possibility of romance and his master''s cultivation of ties with the Nazi cause challenge his carefully maintained veneer of servitude.',15.355589,23237911.0,134.0,'Released','Diamond in the Rough',7.5,202),
 (1246,'Rocky Balboa','2006-12-20 00:00:00.000000',24000000,'http://www.rocky.com/','en','Rocky Balboa','When he loses a highly publicized virtual boxing match to ex-champ Rocky Balboa, reigning heavyweight titleholder, Mason Dixon retaliates by challenging Rocky to a nationally televised, 10-round exhibition bout. To the surprise of his son and friends, Rocky agrees to come out of retirement and face an opponent who''s faster, stronger and thirty years his junior.',30.445257,155721132.0,102.0,'Released','It ain''t over ''til it''s over.',6.5,835),
 (1248,'Hannibal Rising','2007-02-06 00:00:00.000000',50000000,'http://hannibalrising.com/','en','Hannibal Rising','The story of the early, murderous roots of the cannibalistic killer, Hannibal Lecter û from his hard-scrabble Lithuanian childhood, where he witnesses the repulsive lengths to which hungry soldiers will go to satiate themselves, through his sojourn in France, where as a med student he hones his appetite for the kill.',6.567065,82169884.0,121.0,'Released','It started with revenge.',6.0,654),
 (1250,'Ghost Rider','2007-02-16 00:00:00.000000',110000000,'http://www.sonypictures.com/movies/ghostrider/','en','Ghost Rider','In order to save his dying father, young stunt cyclist, Johnny Blaze sells his soul to Mephistopheles and sadly parts from the pure-hearted, Roxanne Simpson, the love of his life. Years later, Johnny''s path crosses again with Roxanne, now a go-getting reporter, and also with Mephistopheles, who offers to release Johnny''s soul if Johnny becomes the fabled, fiery ''Ghost Rider''.',46.834704,228738393.0,114.0,'Released','Hell Is About To Be Unleashed',5.2,1712),
 (1251,'Letters from Iwo Jima','2006-12-19 00:00:00.000000',19000000,'http://iwojimathemovie.warnerbros.com/lettersofiwojima/framework/framework.html','en','Letters from Iwo Jima','The story of the battle of Iwo Jima between the United States and Imperial Japan during World War II, as told from the perspective of the Japanese who fought it.',24.47248,68673228.0,141.0,'Released','The battle of Iwo Jima seen through the eyes of the Japanese soldiers.',7.2,541),
 (1255,'The Host','2006-07-27 00:00:00.000000',11000000,'http://www.hostmovie.com/','ko','??','Gang-du is a dim-witted man working at his father''s tiny snack bar near the Han River. One day, Gang-du''s one and only daughter Hyun-seo comes back from school irritated. She is angry at her uncle, Nam-il, who visited her school as her guardian shamelessly drunk. Ignoring her father''s excuses for Nam-il, Hyun-seo is soon engrossed in her aunt Nam-joo''s archery tournament on TV. Meanwhile, outside of the snack bar, people are fascinated by an unidentified object hanging onto a bridge. In an instant, the object reveals itself as a terrifying creature turning the riverbank into a gruesome sea of bloodíª Amid the chaos, Hyun-seo is helplessly snatched up by the creature right before Gang-du''s eyes. These unforeseen circumstances render the government powerless to act. But receiving a call of help from Hyun-seo, the once-ordinary citizen Gang-du and his family are thrust into a battle with the monster to rescue their beloved Hyun-seo.',27.65527,88489643.0,119.0,'Released','Monsters are real.',6.7,537),
 (1257,'Because I Said So','2007-02-02 00:00:00.000000',0,'http://www.becauseisaidsomovie.com/index_intro.htm','en','Because I Said So','In an effort to prevent family history from repeating itself, meddlesome mom Daphne Wilder attempts to set up her youngest daughter, Milly, with Mr. Right. Meanwhile, her other daughters try to keep their mom''s good intentions under control.',18.678415,69485490.0,102.0,'Released','She''s just your normal, overprotective, overbearing, over-the-top mother.',5.8,191),
 (1259,'Notes on a Scandal','2006-12-25 00:00:00.000000',15000000,'http://www.foxsearchlight.com/NOAS/','en','Notes on a Scandal','"A veteran high school teacher befriends a younger art teacher, who is having an affair with one of her 15-year-old students. However, her intentions with this new ""friend"" also go well beyond platonic friendship."',12.576381,49469904.0,92.0,'Released','One woman''s secret is another woman''s power. One woman''s fear is another woman''s weapon. One woman''s life is in another woman''s hands....',6.9,235),
 (1262,'Stranger Than Fiction','2006-09-09 00:00:00.000000',30000000,'http://www.sonypictures.com/homevideo/strangerthanfiction/','en','Stranger Than Fiction','Everybody knows that your life is a story. But what if a story was your life? Harold Crick is your average IRS agent: monotonous, boring, and repetitive. But one day this all changes when Harold begins to hear an author inside his head narrating his life. But when the narration reveals he is going to die, Harold must find the author and convince them to change the ending.',32.26789,53653224.0,113.0,'Released','Harold Crick isn''t ready to go. Period.',7.1,721),
 (1265,'Bridge to Terabithia','2007-02-16 00:00:00.000000',60000000,'http://disney.go.com/disneyvideos/liveaction/bridgetoterabithia/','en','Bridge to Terabithia','Jesse Aarons trained all summer to become the fastest runner in school, so he''s very upset when newcomer Leslie Burke outruns him and everyone else. Despite this and other differences, including that she''s rich, he''s poor, and she''s a city girl, he''s a country boy, the two become fast friends. Together, they create Terabithia, a land of monsters, trolls, ogres, and giants and rule as king and queen.',40.646102,137587063.0,96.0,'Released','Close your eyes, but keep your mind wide open.',7.0,1113),
