 (1271,'300','2006-12-09 00:00:00.000000',65000000,'http://300themovie.warnerbros.com','en','300','"Based on Frank Miller''s graphic novel, ""300"" is very loosely based the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, where the King of Sparta led his army against the advancing Persians; the battle is said to have inspired all of Greece to band together against the Persians, and helped usher in the world''s first democracy."',65.197968,422610419.0,117.0,'Released','Spartans, prepare for glory!',7.0,4997),
 (1272,'Sunshine','2007-04-05 00:00:00.000000',50000000,NULL,'en','Sunshine','Fifty years into the future, the sun is dying, and Earth is threatened by arctic temperatures. A team of astronauts is sent to revive the Sun ù but the mission fails. Seven years later, a new team is sent to finish the mission as mankindÆs last hope.',51.502884,32017803.0,107.0,'Released','If the sun dies, so do we.',7.0,1182),
