 (1966,'Alexander','2004-11-21 00:00:00.000000',155000000,NULL,'en','Alexander','Alexander, the King of Macedonia, leads his legions against the giant Persian Empire. After defeating the Persians, he leads his army across the then known world, venturing farther than any westerner had ever gone, all the way to India.',39.019229,167298192.0,175.0,'Released','The greatest legend of all was real.',5.6,927),
 (1969,'Bandidas','2006-01-18 00:00:00.000000',35000000,NULL,'es','Bandidas','Set in the late 19th century. When a ruthless robber baron takes away everything they cherish, a rough-and-tumble, idealistic peasant and a sophisticated heiress embark on a quest for justice, vengeanceàand a few good heists.',20.27704,10496317.0,93.0,'Released','Being BAD never looked so GOOD!',5.8,307),
 (1970,'The Grudge','2004-10-22 00:00:00.000000',10000000,NULL,'en','The Grudge','American nurse, Karen Davis moves to Tokyo and encounters a vengeful supernatural spirit known as The Grudge that often possesses its victims. When a series of horrifying and mysterious deaths occur û with the spirit passing its curse onto each victim - Karen must find away to break the spell before she becomes the spirit''s next victim.',35.695442,183474602.0,92.0,'Released','It never forgives. It never forgets.',5.8,865),
 (1975,'The Grudge 2','2006-10-13 00:00:00.000000',20000000,'http://www.sonypictures.com/homevideo/thegrudge2/','en','The Grudge 2','In Tokyo, a young woman is exposed to the same mysterious curse that afflicted her sister. The supernatural force, which fills a person with rage before spreading to its next victim, brings together a group of previously unrelated people who attempt to unlock its secret to save their lives.',13.906944,39143839.0,102.0,'Released','What Was Once Trapped, Will Now Be Unleashed',5.2,283),
 (1979,'Fantastic 4: Rise of the Silver Surfer','2007-06-13 00:00:00.000000',130000000,NULL,'en','4: Rise of the Silver Surfer','The Fantastic Four return to the big screen as a new and all powerful enemy threatens the Earth. The seemingly unstoppable ''Silver Surfer'', but all is not what it seems and there are old and new enemies that pose a greater threat than the intrepid superheroes realize.',60.810723,289047763.0,92.0,'Released','Discover the secret of the Surfer.',5.4,2589),
 (1985,'The Constant Gardener','2005-08-31 00:00:00.000000',25000000,NULL,'en','The Constant Gardener','Justin Quayle is a low-level British diplomat who has always gone about his work very quietly, not causing any problems. But after his radical wife Tessa is killed he becomes determined to find out why, thrusting himself into the middle of a very dangerous conspiracy.',20.679652,82466670.0,129.0,'Released','Love. At any cost.',6.8,417),
 (1988,'A Mighty Heart','2007-01-01 00:00:00.000000',16000000,'http://www.amightyheartmovie.com/','en','A Mighty Heart','Based on Mariane Pearl''s account of the terrifying and unforgettable story of her husband, Wall Street Journal reporter Danny Pearl''s life and death.',9.717392,18928871.0,100.0,'Released','One woman dared to keep hope alive',6.7,95),
