 (3131,'Gangs of New York','2002-12-14 00:00:00.000000',100000000,'http://video.movies.go.com/gangsofnewyork/','en','Gangs of New York','It''s 1863. America was born in the streets. Amsterdam Vallon returns to the Five Points of America to seek vengeance against the psychotic gangland kingpin, Bill the Butcher, who murdered his father years earlier. With an eager pickpocket by his side and a whole new army, Vallon fights his way to seek vengeance on the Butcher and restore peace in the area.',46.160048,193772504.0,167.0,'Released','America was born in the streets.',7.1,1910),
