 (3597,'I Know What You Did Last Summer','1997-10-17 00:00:00.000000',17000000,NULL,'en','I Know What You Did Last Summer','"As they celebrate their high school graduation, four friends are involved in a hit-and-run accident when their car hits and apparently kills a pedestrian on an isolated roadway. They dispose of the body and vow to keep the incident a secret, a year later somebody starts sending them letters bearing the warning ""I Know What You Did Last Summer."""',27.654472,125586134.0,100.0,'Released','If you''re going to bury the truth, make sure it stays buried.',5.6,687),
