 (3635,'Girl with a Pearl Earring','2003-08-31 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','Girl with a Pearl Earring','"This film, adapted from a work of fiction by author Tracy Chevalier, tells a story about the events surrounding the creation of the painting ""Girl With A Pearl Earring"" by 17th century Dutch master Johannes Vermeer. A young peasant maid working in the house of painter Johannes Vermeer becomes his talented assistant and the model for one of his most famous works."',19.944479,31466789.0,101.0,'Released','Discover the mystery behind the legend.',6.4,377),
