 (3902,'I''m Not There.','2007-10-01 00:00:00.000000',20000000,'http://www.imnotthere-movie.com/','en','I''m Not There.','Six actors portray six personas of music legend Bob Dylan in scenes depicting various stages of his life, chronicling his rise from unknown folksinger to international icon and revealing how Dylan constantly reinvented himself.',13.032308,4001121.0,135.0,'Released','All I Can Do Is Be Me Whoever That Is',6.6,195),
 (3933,'Corpse Bride','2005-09-09 00:00:00.000000',40000000,'http://corpsebridemovie.warnerbros.com/','en','Corpse Bride','Set in a 19th-century european village, this stop-motion animation feature follows the story of Victor, a young man whisked away to the underworld and wed to a mysterious corpse bride, while his real bride Victoria waits bereft in the land of the living.',43.571612,117195061.0,77.0,'Released','There''s been a grave misunderstanding.',7.2,1894),
