 (4170,'Trade','2007-01-23 00:00:00.000000',12000000,'http://www.trade-derfilm.de/','en','Trade','A Texas cop (Kevin Kline), whose own daughter might have been forced into sexual slavery, joins forces with a Mexican youth (Cesar Ramos) to find the boy''s sister, who was abducted and forced into prostitution. Meanwhile, a Ukrainian woman who was promised a better life in America also becomes a victim.',11.237374,0.0,120.0,'Released','Each year, more than 1,000,000 people are trafficked across international borders... against their will.',6.8,67),
