 (4515,'Lions for Lambs','2007-10-22 00:00:00.000000',35000000,NULL,'en','Lions for Lambs','Three stories told simultaneous in ninety minutes of real time: a Republican Senator who''s a presidential hopeful gives an hour-long interview to a skeptical television reporter, detailing a strategy for victory in Afghanistan; two special forces ambushed on an Afghani ridge await rescue as Taliban forces close in; a poli-sci professor at a California college invites a student to re-engage.',9.789027,63215872.0,92.0,'Released','If you don''t STAND for something, you might FALL for anything.',6.0,216),
