 (4518,'Elizabeth','1998-09-13 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','Elizabeth','The story of the ascension to the throne and the early reign of Queen Elizabeth the First, the endless attempts by her council to marry her off, the Catholic hatred of her and her romance with Lord Robert Dudley.',14.179538,82150642.0,124.0,'Released','Declared illegitimate aged 3. Tried for treason aged 21. Crowned Queen aged 25.',7.1,334),
 (4523,'Enchanted','2007-11-20 00:00:00.000000',85000000,'http://disney.go.com/disneypictures/enchanted/','en','Enchanted','"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn''t operate on a ""happily ever after"" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?"',29.21998,340487652.0,107.0,'Released','This fairytale princess is about to meet a real Prince Charming',6.6,1449),
 (4547,'Panic Room','2002-03-29 00:00:00.000000',48000000,'http://www.sonypictures.com/movies/panicroom/','en','Panic Room','Trapped in their New York brownstone''s panic room, a hidden chamber built as a sanctuary in the event of break-ins, newly divorced Meg Altman and her young daughter Sarah play a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with three intruders - Burnham, Raoul and Junior - during a brutal home invasion. But the room itself is the focal point because what the intruders really want is inside it.',53.043124,196397415.0,111.0,'Released',NULL,6.5,1267),
