 (4967,'Keeping the Faith','2000-04-14 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','Keeping the Faith','Best friends since they were kids, Rabbi Jacob Schram and Father Brian Finn are dynamic and popular young men living and working on New York''s Upper West Side. When Anna Reilly, once their childhood friend and now grown into a beautiful corporate executive, suddenly returns to the city, she reenters Jake and Brian''s lives and hearts with a vengeance. Sparks fly and an unusual and complicated love triangle ensues.',8.085872,37036004.0,127.0,'Released','If you have to believe in something, you may as well believe in love.',5.9,159),
 (4970,'Gothika','2003-11-21 00:00:00.000000',40000000,'http://gothikamovie.warnerbros.com/','en','Gothika','After a car crash, a criminal psychologist (Halle Berry) comes to, only to find that she''s a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her. It seems she''s been accused of murdering her husband -- but she has no memory of committing the crime. As she tries to regain her memory and convince her co-workers of her innocence, a vengeful spirit uses her as an earthly pawn, which further convinces everyone of her guilt.',27.303608,141591324.0,98.0,'Released','Because someone is dead doesn''t mean they''re gone.',5.8,629),
 (4982,'American Gangster','2007-11-02 00:00:00.000000',100000000,'http://www.americangangster.net/','en','American Gangster','Following the death of his employer and mentor, Bumpy Johnson, Frank Lucas establishes himself as the number one importer of heroin in the Harlem district of Manhattan. He does so by buying heroin directly from the source in South East Asia and he comes up with a unique way of importing the drugs into the United States. Based on a true story.',42.361215,266465037.0,157.0,'Released','There are two sides to the American dream',7.4,1502),
 (4995,'Boogie Nights','1997-09-11 00:00:00.000000',15000000,NULL,'en','Boogie Nights','"Set in 1977, back when sex was safe, pleasure was a business and business was booming, idealistic porn producer Jack Horner aspires to elevate his craft to an art form. Horner discovers Eddie Adams, a hot young talent working as a busboy in a nightclub, and welcomes him into the extended family of movie-makers, misfits and hangers-on that are always around. Adams'' rise from nobody to a celebrity adult entertainer is meteoric, and soon the whole world seems to know his porn alter ego, ""Dirk Diggler"". Now, when disco and drugs are in vogue, fashion is in flux and the party never seems to stop, Adams'' dreams of turning sex into stardom are about to collide with cold, hard reality."',19.85579,43101594.0,155.0,'Released','The life of a dreamer, the days of a business, and the nights in between.',7.5,796),
