 (5072,'Severance','2006-05-19 00:00:00.000000',0,'http://www.severancefilm.com','en','Severance','Members (Danny Dyer, Laura Harris, Tim McInnerny) of the Palisades Defense Corp. sales group arrive in Europe for a team-building exercise. A fallen tree blocks the route, and they must hike to their destination. However, a psychotic killer lurks in the woods, and he has a horrible fate in mind for each of the co-workers.',12.898984,0.0,96.0,'Released','The Company Is Making Cutbacks',6.4,169),
