 (5393,'Happily N''Ever After','2006-09-14 00:00:00.000000',47000000,'http://www.happilyneverafterthefilm.com/','en','Happily N''Ever After','An alliance of evil-doers, led by Frieda, looks to take over Fairy Tale Land. But when Ella realizes her stepmother is out to ruin her storybook existence, she takes a dramatic turn and blossoms into the leader of the resistance effort.',10.410933,38085778.0,75.0,'Released','Fairy Tale Endings Aren''t What They Used To Be',4.6,104),
