 (5822,'Sweet Sweetback''s Baadasssss Song','1971-04-23 00:00:00.000000',150000,'http://www.sonyclassics.com/badass/','en','Sweet Sweetback''s Baadasssss Song','"After saving a Black Panther from some racist cops, a black male prostitute goes on the run from ""the man"" with the help of the ghetto community and some disillusioned Hells Angels."',0.132878,15200000.0,97.0,'Released','The Film that THE MAN doesn''t want you to see!',4.6,18),
