 (6933,'One Missed Call','2008-01-04 00:00:00.000000',20000000,'http://onemissedcallmovie.warnerbros.com/','en','One Missed Call','Several people start receiving voice-mails from their future selves -- messages which include the date, time, and some of the details of their deaths.',12.458131,0.0,87.0,'Released','What will it sound like when you die?',4.7,171),
 (6947,'The Village','2004-07-30 00:00:00.000000',60000000,NULL,'en','The Village','When a willful young man tries to venture beyond his sequestered Pennsylvania hamlet, his actions set off a chain of chilling incidents that will alter the community forever.',27.491891,256697520.0,108.0,'Released','There is no turning back',6.2,1071),
