 (6961,'The Wedding Date','2005-02-04 00:00:00.000000',15000000,'https://www.uphe.com/movies/the-wedding-date','en','The Wedding Date','With the wedding of her younger sister fast approaching, Kat Ellis faces the undesirable prospect of traveling alone to London for the ceremony. While this is bad enough, Jeffrey, the man who left her as they moved closer to marriage, happens to be the groom''s best man. Determined to show everyone -- most of all Jeffrey -- that her romantic life is as full and thrilling as ever, Kat hires a charming male escort as her date.',10.194097,47175038.0,88.0,'Released','Love doesn''t come cheap.',6.2,230),
