 (7299,'Equilibrium','2002-12-06 00:00:00.000000',20000000,NULL,'en','Equilibrium','In a dystopian future, a totalitarian regime maintains peace by subduing the populace with a drug, and displays of emotion are punishable by death. A man in charge of enforcing the law rises to overthrow the system.',44.566609,5359645.0,107.0,'Released','In a future where freedom is outlawed, outlaws will become heroes.',6.9,1552),
