 (9003,'Hellraiser','1987-09-11 00:00:00.000000',1000000,NULL,'en','Hellraiser','Larry and his wife, Julia move into an old house and discover a hideous creature - the man''s half-brother, who is also the woman''s former lover - hiding upstairs. Having lost his earthly body to a trio of S&amp;M demons, the Cenobites, Frank, is brought back into existence by a drop of blood on the floor. He soon forces his former mistress to bring him his necessary human sacrifices to complete his body... but the Cenobites won''t be happy about this.',22.583834,14564027.0,94.0,'Released','He''ll tear your soul apart.',6.9,449),
 (9007,'Just Like Heaven','2005-09-16 00:00:00.000000',58000000,NULL,'en','Just Like Heaven','Shortly after David Abbott moves into his new San Francisco digs, he has an unwelcome visitor on his hands: winsome Elizabeth Martinson, who asserts that the apartment is hers -- and promptly vanishes. When she starts appearing and disappearing at will, David thinks she''s a ghost, while Elizabeth is convinced she''s alive.',13.43573,102854431.0,95.0,'Released','It''s a wonderful afterlife.',6.5,579),
 (9008,'The Insider','1999-10-28 00:00:00.000000',90000000,NULL,'en','The Insider','Tells the true story of a 60 Minutes television series exposT of the tobacco industry, as seen through the eyes of a real tobacco executive, Jeffrey Wigand',26.153669,60289912.0,157.0,'Released','Two men driven to tell the truth... whatever the cost.',7.3,481),
 (9009,'Dark Water','2005-06-27 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','Dark Water','Dahlia Williams and her daughter Cecelia move into a rundown apartment on New York''s Roosevelt Island. She is currently in midst of divorce proceedings and the apartment, though near an excellent school for her daughter, is all she can afford. From the time she arrives, there are mysterious occurrences and there is a constant drip from the ceiling in her daughter''s bedroom.',14.376463,25473093.0,105.0,'Released','This Season, The Mystery Of The Darkness Will Consume Your Life',5.3,274),
 (9012,'Jackass: The Movie','2002-10-21 00:00:00.000000',5000000,NULL,'en','Jackass: The Movie','Johnny Knoxville and his crazy friends appear on the big screen for the very first time in Jackass: The Movie. They wander around Japan in panda outfits, wreak havoc on a once civilized golf course, they even do stunts involving LIVE alligators, and so on. While Johnny Knoxvile and his pals put their life at risk, they are entertaining people at the same time. Get ready for Jackass: The Movie!!',14.752587,64282312.0,87.0,'Released','Do not attempt this at home.',6.1,345),
 (9013,'Midnight Run','1988-07-20 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','Midnight Run','An accountant embezzles $15 million of mob money, jumps bail and is chased by bounty hunters, the FBI, and the Mafia.',12.821329,38413606.0,126.0,'Released','This could be the beginning of a beautiful friendship.',7.2,238),
 (9016,'Treasure Planet','2002-11-26 00:00:00.000000',140000000,NULL,'en','Treasure Planet','"When space galleon cabin boy Jim Hawkins discovers a map to an intergalactic ""loot of a thousand worlds,"" a cyborg cook named John Silver teaches him to battle supernovas and space storms. But, soon, Jim realizes Silver is a pirate intent on mutiny!"',38.924136,109578115.0,95.0,'Released','Find your place in the universe.',7.2,948),
 (9021,'The Santa Clause 2','2002-10-31 00:00:00.000000',65000000,NULL,'en','The Santa Clause 2','Better watch out! The big guy in red is coming to town once again. This time, Scott Calvin -- also known as Santa Claus -- finds out there''s an obscure clause in his contract requiring him to take on a wife. He has to leave the North Pole to fulfill his obligations, or else he''ll be forced to give up his Yuletide gig.',14.646884,172855065.0,104.0,'Released','What''s Christmas Fun without some Reindeer Games?',5.5,297),
 (9022,'All the Boys Love Mandy Lane','2008-02-15 00:00:00.000000',750000,'http://www.mandylane.co.uk','en','All the Boys Love Mandy Lane','Beautiful Mandy Lane isn''t a party girl but, when classmate Chloe invites the Texas high school student to a bash in the countryside, she reluctantly accepts. After hitching a ride with a vaguely scary older man, the teens arrive at their destination. Partying ensues, and Mandy''s close pal, Emmet, keeps a watchful eye on the young males making a play for Mandy. Then two of the students are murdered.',12.284939,0.0,90.0,'Released','Everyone is dying to be with her. Someone is killing for it.',5.7,209),
 (9023,'Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron','2002-05-24 00:00:00.000000',80000000,NULL,'en','Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron','As a wild stallion travels across the frontiers of the Old West, he befriends a young human and finds true love with a mare.',41.670544,122563539.0,83.0,'Released','Leader. Hero. Legend.',7.4,831),
 (9026,'The Importance of Being Earnest','2002-05-17 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','The Importance of Being Earnest','"Two young gentlemen living in 1890s England use the same pseudonym (""Ernest"") on the sly, which is fine until they both fall in love with women using that name, which leads to a comedy of mistaken identities..."',7.250379,0.0,97.0,'Released','Everybody Loves Ernest... But Nobody''s Quite Sure Who He Really Is.',6.7,127),
 (9027,'The Guru','2002-08-21 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','The Guru','Bored with Bollywood movies but fascinated with their Hollywood counterparts from his youth, Ram dreams to become a singer and actor in America, the country where dreams are made. He is encouraged when his American-based close friend, Vijay Rao, comes for visit, and brags about driving a Mercedes and living in a penthouse.',4.093288,0.0,91.0,'Released','When he talks, women listen.',5.1,75),
 (9029,'What Happens in Vegas','2008-05-07 00:00:00.000000',35000000,NULL,'da','What Happens in Vegas','During a wild vacation in Las Vegas, career woman Joy McNally and playboy Jack Fuller come to the sober realization that they have married each other after a night of drunken abandon. They are then compelled, for legal reasons, to live life as a couple for a limited period of time. At stake is a large amount of money.',38.100488,170000000.0,99.0,'Released','Get Lucky',5.8,923),
 (9030,'The Eye','2008-02-01 00:00:00.000000',12000000,'http://www.theeyethefilm.com','en','The Eye','Violinist Sydney Wells was accidentally blinded by her sister Helen when she was five years old. She submits to a cornea transplantation, and while recovering from the operation, she realizes that she is seeing dead people.',11.135734,56309766.0,98.0,'Released','How can you believe your eyes when they''re not yours?',5.5,281),
 (9032,'Big Daddy','1999-06-25 00:00:00.000000',34200000,NULL,'en','Big Daddy','A lazy law school grad adopts a kid to impress his girlfriend, but everything doesn''t go as planned and he becomes the unlikely foster father.',34.86859,234801895.0,93.0,'Released','Nature called. Look who answered.',6.1,875),
 (9034,'The Banger Sisters','2002-09-20 00:00:00.000000',10000000,NULL,'en','The Banger Sisters','In the late ''60s, the self-proclaimed belles of the rock ''n'' roll ball, rocked the worlds of every music legend whose pants they could take off -- and they have the pictures to prove it. But it''s been more than two decades since the Banger Sisters earned their nickname -- or even laid eyes on each other. Their reunion is the collision of two women''s worlds; one who''s living in the past, and one who''s hiding from it. Together they learn to live in the moment.',6.015354,0.0,98.0,'Released','Some friendships last forever... like it or not.',5.5,62),
 (9035,'Slither','2006-03-31 00:00:00.000000',15500000,NULL,'en','Slither','A small town is taken over by an alien plague, turning residents into zombies and all forms of mutant monsters.',17.327279,0.0,95.0,'Released','Horror Has A New Face',6.3,317),
 (9036,'Eight Below','2006-02-17 00:00:00.000000',40000000,NULL,'en','Eight Below','In the Antarctic, after an expedition with Dr. Davis McClaren, the sled dog trainer Jerry Shepherd has to leave the polar base with his colleagues due to the proximity of a heavy snow storm. He ties his dogs to be rescued after, but the mission is called-off and the dogs are left alone at their own fortune. For six months, Jerry tries to find a sponsor for a rescue mission.',24.287306,120455994.0,120.0,'Released','The Most Amazing Story Of Survival, Friendship, And Adventure Ever Told.',6.7,542),
 (9042,'The Cave','2005-08-25 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','The Cave','After a group of biologists discovers a huge network of unexplored caves in Romania and, believing it to be an undisturbed eco-system that has produced a new species, they hire the best American team of underwater cave explorers in the world. While exploring deeper into the underwater caves, a rockslide blocks their exit, and they soon discover a larger carnivorous creature has added them to its food chain.',10.756266,15007991.0,97.0,'Released','There are places man was never meant to go.',5.1,202),
 (9043,'The Family Stone','2005-12-14 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','The Family Stone','An uptight, conservative, businesswoman accompanies her boyfriend to his eccentric and outgoing family''s annual Christmas celebration and finds that she''s a fish out of water in their free-spirited way of life.',14.190837,0.0,103.0,'Released','Feel The Love',6.2,249),
 (9045,'Amen.','2002-02-13 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'fr','Amen.','"The film ""Amen."" examines the links between the Vatican and Nazi Germany. The central character is Kurt Gerstein, a member of the Institute for Hygiene of the Waffen-SS who is horrified by what he sees in the death camps. Moreover, he is shocked to learn that the process he used to purify water for his troops, by using zyklon, served as a basis to kill people in gas chambers."',5.930533,0.0,132.0,'Released','Two Men   Two Worlds   One Cause',7.1,75),
 (9053,'DOA: Dead or Alive','2006-09-07 00:00:00.000000',21000000,NULL,'en','DOA: Dead or Alive','Four beautiful rivals at an invitation-only martial-arts tournament join forces against a sinister threat. Princess Kasumi is an aristocratic warrior trained by martial-arts masters. Tina Armstrong is a wrestling superstar. Helena Douglas is an athlete with a tragic past. Christie Allen earns her keep as a thief and an assassin-for-hire.',12.790408,480314.0,87.0,'Released','They''re the ultimate fighters. They''ve got the looks. They''ve got the moves, and the men fall at their feet.',5.0,205),
 (9059,'Tales from the Crypt: Demon Knight','1995-01-13 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','Tales from the Crypt: Demon Knight','A man on the run is hunted by a demon known as the Collector.',7.710797,0.0,92.0,'Released','Ready for your deadtime story?',6.7,94),
 (9067,'Tank Girl','1995-03-31 00:00:00.000000',25000000,NULL,'en','Tank Girl','Based on the British cult comic-strip, our tank-riding anti-heroine fights a mega-corporation, which controls the world''s water supply.',8.186936,4064495.0,98.0,'Released','In 2033, justice rides a tank and wears lip gloss.',5.5,138),
 (9072,'Little Man','2006-08-31 00:00:00.000000',64000000,'http://www.littleman-movie.com/','en','Little Man','After leaving the prison, the dwarf criminal Calvin Sims joins to his moron brother Percy to steal an expensive huge diamond in a jewelry for the mobster Walken. They are chased by the police, and Calvin hides the stone in the purse of the executive Vanessa Edwards, whose husband Darryl Edwards wants to have a baby. Percy convinces Calvin to dress like a baby and be left in front of the Edwards''s house to get inside the house and retrieve the diamond. Darryl and Vanessa keep Calvin for the weekend and decide to adopt him, while Walken threatens Darryl to get the stone back.',12.421504,101595121.0,98.0,'Released','Big things come in small packages',5.3,261),
 (9074,'The Man','2005-09-08 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','The Man','Special Agent Derrick Vann is a man out to get the man who killed his partner but a case of mistaken identity leads him to Andy Fidler, a salesman with too many questions and a knack of getting in Vanns way',6.925645,12382362.0,83.0,'Released','One guy walks the walk. The other talks and talks.',5.4,133),
 (9075,'Black Book','2006-09-01 00:00:00.000000',21000000,NULL,'nl','Zwartboek','In the Nazi-occupied Netherlands during World War II, a Jewish singer infiltrates the regional Gestapo headquarters for the Dutch resistance.',13.906611,26193068.0,145.0,'Released','To fight the enemy, she must become one of them.',7.2,277),
 (9087,'The American President','1995-11-17 00:00:00.000000',62000000,NULL,'en','The American President','Widowed U.S. president Andrew Shepherd, one of the world''s most powerful men, can have anything he wants -- and what he covets most is Sydney Ellen Wade, a Washington lobbyist. But Shepherd''s attempts at courting her spark wild rumors and decimate his approval ratings.',11.056763,107879496.0,106.0,'Released','Why can''t the most powerful man in the world have the one thing he wants most?',6.5,195),
 (9089,'Home for the Holidays','1995-11-02 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','Home for the Holidays','After losing her job, making out with her soon to be ex-boss, and finding out that her daughter plans to spend Thanksgiving with her boyfriend, Claudia Larson has to face spending the holiday with her family. She wonders if she can survive their crazy antics.',4.031585,17519169.0,103.0,'Released','We''ll do it every year..until we get it right',6.3,39),
 (9092,'Snow White: A Tale of Terror','1997-07-18 00:00:00.000000',26000000,NULL,'en','Snow White: A Tale of Terror','Based somewhat more authentically on the Grimm Brothers'' story of a young woman who is unliked by her stepmother, the film includes the talking mirror, a poisoned apple, and some ruffian gold (not diamond) miners (and they aren''t dwarfs or cute). It takes place at the time of the Crusades, and depicts the attitudes of the wealthy and the peasant classes toward one another.',4.810621,0.0,100.0,'Released','The fairy tale is over.',6.0,62),
 (9093,'The Four Feathers','2002-09-08 00:00:00.000000',35000000,NULL,'en','The Four Feathers','The story, set in 1875, follows a British officer (Heath Ledger) who resigns his post when he learns of his regiment''s plan to ship out to the Sudan for the conflict with the Mahdi. His friends and fiancTe send him four white feathers which symbolize cowardice. To redeem his honor he disguises himself as an Arab and secretly saves the lives of those who branded him a coward.',10.10364,29882645.0,132.0,'Released','Freedom. Country. Honor. Passion. To save his best friend, one man must risk everything he loves.',6.5,159),
 (9095,'Mary Reilly','1996-02-23 00:00:00.000000',47000000,NULL,'en','Mary Reilly','A housemaid falls in love with Dr. Jekyll and his darkly mysterious counterpart, Mr. Hyde.',6.067212,12379402.0,104.0,'Released','The untold story of Jekyll and Hyde',5.7,74),
 (9096,'Medicine Man','1992-02-07 00:00:00.000000',40000000,NULL,'en','Medicine Man','"An eccentric scientist working for a large drug company is working on a research project in the Amazon jungle. He sends for a research assistant and a gas chromatograph because he''s close to a cure for cancer. When the assistant turns out to be a ""mere woman,"" he rejects her help. Meanwhile the bulldozers get closer to the area in which they are conducting research, and they eventually learn to work together, and begin falling in love."',7.021871,0.0,106.0,'Released','He turned his back on civilization. Only to discover he had the power to save it.',5.8,114),
 (9099,'Sgt. Bilko','1996-03-29 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','Sgt. Bilko','The army is known for churning out lean mean fighting machines intent on protecting our great nation. Martin is the inexplicable the incorrigible the invicible sgt. Ernie bilko leader of a ragtag group of the sorriest soldiers ever to enlist in the armed forces.',5.417787,0.0,90.0,'Released','All he ever wanted was an honest week''s pay for an honest day''s work.',5.5,94),
 (9100,'The Craft','1996-05-03 00:00:00.000000',15000000,NULL,'en','The Craft','A Catholic school newcomer falls in with a clique of teen witches who wield their powers against all who dare to cross them -- be they teachers, rivals or meddlesome parents.',19.517239,24769466.0,101.0,'Released','Welcome to the witching hour.',6.3,380),
 (9104,'Buffalo Soldiers','2001-09-08 00:00:00.000000',15000000,NULL,'en','Buffalo Soldiers','Set just before the fall of the Berlin Wall in 1989, Sgt. Ray Elwood is an American soldier stationed at a German army camp. A soldier because a judge gave him a choice between the army and jail, Ray spends much of his free time cooking cocaine for the MPs. When a soldier dies and a toxicology screen shows an alarming level of illegal narcotics, someone is sent in to investigate.',6.329672,0.0,98.0,'Released','War is hell... but peace is f*#!%!! boring.',6.5,93),
 (9208,'Broken Arrow','1996-02-09 00:00:00.000000',50000000,NULL,'en','Broken Arrow','When rogue stealth-fighter pilot Vic Deakins deliberately drops off the radar while on maneuvers, the Air Force ends up with two stolen nuclear warheads -- and Deakins''s co-pilot, Riley Hale, is the military''s only hope for getting them back. Traversing the deserted canyons of Utah, Hale teams with park ranger Terry Carmichael to put Deakins back in his box.',22.769108,150270147.0,108.0,'Released','Prepare to Go Ballistic.',5.7,453),
 (9257,'S.W.A.T.','2003-08-08 00:00:00.000000',80000000,'http://www.sonypictures.com/homevideo/swat/','en','S.W.A.T.','Hondo Harrelson recruits Jim Street to join an elite unit of the Los Angeles Police Department. Together they seek out more members, including tough Deke Kay and single mom Chris Sanchez. The team''s first big assignment is to escort crime boss Alex Montel to prison. It seems routine, but when Montel offers a huge reward to anyone who can break him free, criminals of various stripes step up for the prize.',34.052253,116643346.0,117.0,'Released','You''re either S.W.A.T. or you''re not.',5.8,770),
 (9260,'Welcome to Collinwood','2002-05-24 00:00:00.000000',1200000,NULL,'en','Welcome to Collinwood','Five hapless inner-city low-lifes attempt to burgle a pawnbroker''s safe, but end up being plagued by bad luck.',3.582733,0.0,86.0,'Released','Five guys. One safe. No brains.',6.2,50),
 (9266,'Blue Crush','2002-08-08 00:00:00.000000',25000000,NULL,'en','Blue Crush','Nothing gets between Anne Marie and her board. Living in a beach shack with three roommates, she is up before dawn every morning to conquer the waves and count the days until the Pipe Masters competition. Having transplanted herself to Hawaii with no one''s blessing but her own, Anne Marie finds all she needs in the adrenaline-charged surf scene - until pro quarterback Matt Tollman comes along...',11.42943,51842679.0,104.0,'Released','Three Friends, One Passion, No Limits.',5.6,159),
 (9268,'Eraser','1996-06-21 00:00:00.000000',100000000,'http://www.warnerbros.com/eraser','en','Eraser','U.S. Marshall John Kruger erases the identities of people enrolled in the Witness Protection Program. His current assignment is to protect Lee Cullen, who''s uncovered evidence that the weapons manufacturer she works for has been selling to terrorist groups. When Kruger discovers that there''s a corrupt agent within the program, he must guard his own life while trying to protect Lee''s.',24.507987,242295562.0,115.0,'Released','He will erase your past to protect your future.',5.6,543),
