 (9312,'Mortal Kombat','1995-08-18 00:00:00.000000',18000000,NULL,'en','Mortal Kombat','For nine generations an evil sorcerer has been victorious in hand-to-hand battle against his mortal enemies. If he wins a tenth Mortal Kombat tournament, desolation and evil will reign over the multiverse forever. To save Earth, three warriors must overcome seemingly insurmountable odds, their own inner demons, and superhuman foes in this action/adventure movie based on one of the most popular video games of all time.',16.470895,122195920.0,101.0,'Released','Nothing In This World Has Prepared You For This.',5.4,442),
 (9313,'The Man in the Iron Mask','1998-03-12 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','The Man in the Iron Mask','Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D''Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.',28.98027,0.0,132.0,'Released','For the honor of a king. And the destiny of a country. All for one.',6.3,1018),
 (9315,'Flightplan','2005-09-22 00:00:00.000000',55000000,NULL,'en','Flightplan','A claustrophobic, Hitchcockian thriller. A bereaved woman and her daughter are flying home from Berlin to America. At 30,000 feet the child vanishes and nobody admits she was ever on that plane.',32.05145,223387299.0,98.0,'Released','If Someone Took Everything You Live For... How Far Would You Go To Get It Back?',6.1,772),
 (9327,'The Nutty Professor','1996-06-26 00:00:00.000000',54000000,NULL,'en','The Nutty Professor','Eddie Murphy stars as shy Dr. Sherman Klump, a kind, brilliant, ''calorifically challenged'' genetic professor. When beautiful Carla Purty joins the university faculty, Sherman grows desperate to whittle his 400-pound frame down to size and win her heart. So, with one swig of his experimental fat-reducing serum, Sherman becomes ''Buddy Love'', a fast-talking, pumped-up , plumped down Don Juan.',20.28119,128769345.0,95.0,'Released','Inside Sherman Klump, a party animal is about to break out.',5.4,702),
 (9331,'Clear and Present Danger','1994-08-03 00:00:00.000000',62000000,NULL,'en','Clear and Present Danger','CIA Analyst Jack Ryan is drawn into an illegal war fought by the US government against a Colombian drug cartel.',18.832471,215887717.0,141.0,'Released','The war of drugs would lead him to the war of power.',6.4,386),
