 (9357,'One Hour Photo','2002-08-21 00:00:00.000000',12000000,NULL,'en','One Hour Photo','"Sy ""the photo guy"" Parrish has lovingly developed photos for the Yorkin family since their son was a baby. But as the Yorkins'' lives become fuller, Sy''s only seems lonelier, until he eventually believes he''s part of their family. When ""Uncle"" Sy''s picture-perfect fantasy collides with an ugly dose of reality, what happens next ""has the spine-tingling elements of the best psychological thrillers!"""',20.624896,52223306.0,96.0,'Released','The things that we fear the most have already happened to us...',6.6,435),
