 (9398,'Zoolander','2001-09-28 00:00:00.000000',28000000,NULL,'en','Zoolander','"Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1''s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic ""he''s so hot right now"" Hansel scooters in to steal this year''s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. Its a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories can Derek make the world safe."',38.0958,60780981.0,89.0,'Released','3% Body Fat. 1% Brain Activity.',6.1,1337),
