 (9433,'The Edge','1997-09-06 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','The Edge','The plane carrying wealthy Charles Morse crashes down in the Alaskan wilderness. Together with the two other passengers, photographer Robert and assistant Stephen, Charles devises a plan to help them reach civilization. However, his biggest obstacle might not be the elements, or even the Kodiak bear stalking them -- it could be Robert, whom Charles suspects is having an affair with his wife and would not mind seeing him dead.',20.632673,43312294.0,117.0,'Released','They were fighting over a woman when the plane went down. Now, their only chance for survival is each other.',6.7,349),
