 (9662,'The Triplets of Belleville','2003-06-11 00:00:00.000000',8000000,'http://www.sonyclassics.com/triplets/','fr','Les triplettes de Belleville','When her grandson is kidnapped during the Tour de France, Madame Souza and her beloved pooch Bruno team up with the Belleville Sisters--an aged song-and-dance team from the days of Fred Astaire--to rescue him.',13.944645,1477676.0,80.0,'Released',NULL,7.3,231),
 (9664,'Flyboys','2006-09-22 00:00:00.000000',60000000,NULL,'en','Flyboys','The adventures of the Lafayette Escadrille, young Americans who volunteered for the French military before the U.S. entered World War I, and became the country''s first fighter pilots.',13.155999,17800000.0,140.0,'Released','Inspired by a true story',6.3,271),
 (9665,'Glory','1989-12-15 00:00:00.000000',18000000,NULL,'en','Glory','Robert Gould Shaw leads the US Civil War''s first all-black volunteer company, fighting prejudices of both his own Union army and the Confederates.',16.102271,26828365.0,122.0,'Released','Their innocence. Their heritage. Their lives.',7.4,383),
 (9667,'The Jacket','2005-03-04 00:00:00.000000',29000000,NULL,'en','The Jacket','A military veteran goes on a journey into the future, where he can foresee his death and is left with questions that could save his life and those he loves.',24.240361,21126225.0,103.0,'Released','Terror has a new name.',6.8,455),
 (9671,'Crocodile Dundee','1986-09-26 00:00:00.000000',5000000,NULL,'en','Crocodile Dundee','When a New York reporter plucks crocodile hunter Dundee from the Australian Outback for a visit to the Big Apple, it''s a clash of cultures and a recipe for good-natured comedy as nanve Dundee negotiates the concrete jungle. Dundee proves that his instincts are quite useful in the city and adeptly handles everything from wily muggers to high-society snoots without breaking a sweat.',16.072466,328203506.0,97.0,'Released','There''s a little of him in all of us.',6.3,503),
