 (9759,'Cellular','2004-09-06 00:00:00.000000',25000000,'http://www.cellularthemovie.com/','en','Cellular','A young man receives an emergency phone call on his cell phone from an older woman. She claims to have been kidnapped û and the kidnappers have targeted her husband and child next.',24.459948,56422687.0,94.0,'Released','If the signal dies so does she',6.1,537),
 (9760,'Epic Movie','2007-01-25 00:00:00.000000',20000000,NULL,'en','Epic Movie','When Edward, Peter, Lucy and Susan each follow their own path, they end up finding themselves at Willy''s Chocolate factory. Walking through a wardrobe, they discover the world of Gnarnia, which is ruled by the White Bitch. Meeting up with characters such as Harry Potter and Captain Jack Swallows, the newly reunited family must team up with Aslo, a wise-but-horny lion to stop the white bitch''s army',6.064638,86865564.0,86.0,'Released','We know it''s big. We measured.',3.2,326),
