 (9763,'Goal!: The Dream Begins','2005-06-06 00:00:00.000000',30000000,NULL,'en','Goal!: The Dream Begins','Like millions of kids around the world, Santiago harbors the dream of being a professional footballer...However, living in the Barrios section of Los Angeles, he thinks it is only that--a dream. Until one day an extraordinary turn of events has him trying out for Premiership club Newcastle United.',16.541791,27610873.0,118.0,'Released','Every Dream Has A Beginning',6.6,238),
