 (9800,'Philadelphia','1993-12-22 00:00:00.000000',26000000,NULL,'en','Philadelphia','No one would take his case until one man was willing to take on the system. Two competing lawyers join forces to sue a prestigious law firm for AIDS discrimination. As their unlikely friendship develops their courage overcomes the prejudice and corruption of their powerful adversaries.',44.301745,206678440.0,125.0,'Released','No one would take on his case... until one man was willing to take on the system.',7.6,988),
