 (9900,'Grandma''s Boy','2006-01-06 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','Grandma''s Boy','Even though he''s 35, Alex acts more like he''s 13, spending his days as the world''s oldest video game tester and his evenings developing the next big Xbox game. But he gets kicked out of his apartment and is forced to move in with his grandmother.',9.974681,6538177.0,94.0,'Released','A movie that proves you''re never too old to come of age.',6.6,220),
