 (9928,'Robots','2005-03-10 00:00:00.000000',75000000,NULL,'en','Robots','Rodney Copperbottom is a young robot inventor who dreams of making the world a better place, until the evil Ratchet takes over Big Weld Industries. Now, Rodney''s dreams û and those of his friends û are in danger of becoming obsolete.',29.558157,260696994.0,91.0,'Released','You can shine no matter what you''re made of.',6.0,1333),
