 (10133,'Cypher','2002-10-01 00:00:00.000000',7500000,'http://www.miramax.com/cypher/','en','Cypher','An unsuspecting, disenchanted man finds himself working as a spy in the dangerous, high-stakes world of corporate espionage. Quickly getting way over-his-head, he teams up with a mysterious femme fatale.',11.636883,0.0,95.0,'Released','Never forget who you are',6.7,192),
