 (10724,'Firefox','1982-06-13 00:00:00.000000',18000000,NULL,'en','Firefox','"The Soviets have developed a revolutionary new jet fighter, called ""Firefox"". Naturally, the British are worried that the jet will be used as a first-strike weapon, as rumours say that the jet is indetectable on radar. They send ex-Vietnam War pilot Mitchell Gant on a covert mission into the Soviet Union to steal Firefox."',8.700565,70687344.0,136.0,'Released','...the most devastating killing machine ever built... his job... steal it!',5.5,139),
