 (10858,'Nixon','1995-12-22 00:00:00.000000',44000000,NULL,'en','Nixon','An all-star cast powers this epic look at American President Richard M. Nixon, a man carrying the fate of the world on his shoulders while battling the self-destructive demands from within. Spanning his troubled boyhood in California to the shocking Watergate scandal that would end his presidency.',3.770161,13681765.0,192.0,'Released','Triumphant in Victory, Bitter in Defeat. He Changed the World, But Lost a Nation.',7.1,71),
