 (11024,'Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed','2004-03-24 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed','When Mystery, Inc. are guests of honor at the grand opening of the Coolsville Museum of Criminology, a masked villain shows up and creates havoc before stealing the costumes of the gang''s most notorious villains...Could it be that their nemesis, mad scientist Jonathan Jacobo has returned and is trying to recreate their deadliest foes?',22.644275,181466833.0,93.0,'Released','They came. They saw. They ran.',5.4,500),
 (11025,'New York Minute','2004-05-01 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'en','New York Minute','Top student Jane Ryan heads to Manhattan for a college-scholarship competition. Her rebellious twin Roxy Ryan goes along to crash a video shoot. But anything can happen - and does - in a romp involving a pursuing truant officer, a smuggler, hunkalicious guys and the girls'' realization that when the chips are down, a sister can be the best friend of all.',10.0403,0.0,91.0,'Released',NULL,5.5,185),
 (11026,'Exorcist: The Beginning','2004-08-20 00:00:00.000000',80000000,NULL,'en','Exorcist: The Beginning','Having lived through traumatizing events during WWII, Father Lankester Merrin takes a sabbatical from the Church to conduct archaeological excavations in British-administered East Africa. Merrin unearths an ancient Byzantine church believed have been built and then immediately buried to keep down evil from the crypt below. The natives are convinced that uncovering the church has unleashed a demon, and begin to violently clash with the British military troops. As the village rapidly disintegrates into chaos and war, Merrin must face-off with the demon which has taken possession of somebody close to him.',15.761384,78000586.0,114.0,'Released','Go back to where the horror began.',4.7,183),
 (11027,'The Postman Always Rings Twice','1981-03-20 00:00:00.000000',12000000,NULL,'en','The Postman Always Rings Twice','This remake of the 1946 movie of the same name accounts an affair between a seedy drifter and a seductive wife of a roadside cafe owner. This begins a chain of events that culminates in murder. Based on a novel by James M. Cain.',6.803763,0.0,122.0,'Released','You Will Feel The Heat',6.4,110),
