 (11190,'The Return','2003-06-25 00:00:00.000000',0,NULL,'ru','???????????','A story of two Russian boys whose father suddenly returns home after a 12-year absence. He takes the boys on a holiday to a remote island on a lake that turns into a test of manhood of almost mythic proportions.',7.744166,0.0,105.0,'Released',NULL,7.4,100),
