 (11199,'Wild Hogs','2007-03-02 00:00:00.000000',0,'http://video.movies.go.com/wildhogs/','en','Wild Hogs','Restless and ready for adventure, four suburban bikers leave the safety of their subdivision and head out on the open road. But complications ensue when they cross paths with an intimidating band of New Mexico bikers known as the Del Fuegos.',31.719463,253625427.0,100.0,'Released','A lot can happen on the road to nowhere.',5.6,648),
 (11202,'Patton','1970-01-25 00:00:00.000000',12000000,NULL,'en','Patton','"""Patton"" tells the tale of General George S. Patton, famous tank commander of World War II. The film begins with patton''s career in North Africa and progresses through the invasion of Germany and the fall of the Third Reich. Side plots also speak of Patton''s numerous faults such his temper and habit towards insubordination."',21.933822,89800000.0,172.0,'Released','The Rebel Warrior',7.3,323),
