 (11287,'A League of Their Own','1992-07-01 00:00:00.000000',40000000,NULL,'en','A League of Their Own','Small-town sisters Dottie and Kit join an all-female baseball league formed after World War II brings pro baseball to a standstill. When their team hits the road with its drunken coach, the siblings find troubles and triumphs on and off the field.',21.661028,107458785.0,128.0,'Released','To achieve the incredible, you have to attempt the impossible.',6.7,354),
 (11298,'The Howling','1981-04-03 00:00:00.000000',1000000,NULL,'en','The Howling','After a bizarre and near fatal encounter with a serial killer, a newswoman is sent to a rehabilitation center whose inhabitants may not be what they seem.',6.532855,17985893.0,91.0,'Released','Imagine your worst fear a reality',6.4,161),
